ing for. Head back to our {homepageLink} or try the links in the footer. If you need help, you can visit our {supportPageLink}.\",\"404PageTextMagazine\":\"We couldn\\'t find the page you were looking for. Head back to the {magazineLink} or try the links in the footer. If you need help, you can visit our {supportPageLink}.\",\"404PageTitle\":\"Oops\",\"applicableSalesTax\":\"applicable sales tax\",\"benefits\":{\"1\":{\"songsVideos\":\"Over 180 million songs and over 650,000 videos\"},\"2\":{\"adFree\":\"Completely ad-free\"},\"3\":{\"audioQuality\":\"The highest quality audio available\"},\"4\":{\"anytimeAnywhere\":\"Listen anytime & anywhere\"},\"5\":{\"exclusiveAccess\":\"Exclusive member access to VIP pop-up shows, ticket giveaways, meet-and-greets and behind-the-scenes content\"},\"header\":{\"30daysFree\":\"Get 30 days free\",\"60daysFree\":\"Get 60 days free\",\"90daysFree\":\"Get 90 days free\"}},\"button\":{\"30dayTrial\":\"Start 30-Day Free Trial\",\"cancelAnytime\":\"Cancel anytime.\",\"done\":\"Done\",\"getFree\":\"Get Free\",\"getHelp\":\"Get Help\",\"getHiFi\":\"Get HiFi\",\"goToHomepage\":\"Go to Homepage\",\"iAccept\":\"I Accept\",\"iUnderstand\":\"I Understand\",\"learnMore\":\"Learn More\",\"noThanks\":\"No thanks\",\"openInTIDAL\":\"Open in TIDAL\",\"playAgain\":\"Play again\",\"readMore\":\"Read More\",\"redeem\":\"Redeem\",\"redeemGiftcard\":\"Redeem Giftcard\",\"redeemNow\":\"Redeem Now\",\"redeemOffer\":\"Redeem Offer\",\"redeemTidal\":\"Redeem TIDAL\",\"redeemVoucher\":\"Redeem Voucher\",\"seeMore\":\"See more\",\"signUp\":\"Sign up\",\"start30DayTrial\":\"Start your 30-day trial now.\",\"start60DayTrial\":\"Start your 60-day trial now.\",\"start90DayTrial\":\"Start your 90-day trial now.\",\"startFreeTrial\":\"Start Free Trial\",\"startStreaming\":\"Start streaming\",\"startTrial\":\"Start Trial\",\"submit\":\"Submit\",\"watchAgain\":\"Watch Again\"},\"cookie\":{\"policy\":{\"US\":\"We and trusted third parties use cookies and similar technology on this website. To find out more, <a href=\\\\\"https://tidal.com/privacy\\\\\" target=\\\\\"_blank\\\\\">click here</a>.\"},\"policyDesktop\":\"By closing this message, you consent to TIDAL\\'s use of cookies on this device in accordance with its <a href=\\\\\"https://tidal.com/privacy\\\\\" target=\\\\\"_blank\\\\\">cookies policy</a>, unless you have disabled them through your browser settings\",\"policyMobile\":\"By closing this message, you consent to TIDAL\\'s use of cookies on this device in accordance with our <a href=\\\\\"https://tidal.com/privacy\\\\\" target=\\\\\"_blank\\\\\">cookies policy</a>.\",\"text\":\"We use cookies and similar technologies to recognize your repeat visits and preferences, as well as to measure the effectiveness of campaigns and analyze traffic. By clicking \\\\\"I Accept\\\\\" or \\\\\"X\\\\\" on this banner, or using our site, you consent to the use of cookies unless you have disabled them. To find out more, <a href=\\\\\"https://tidal.com/privacy\\\\\" target=\\\\\"_blank\\\\\">click here</a>.\",\"title\":\"Cookie Policy\"},\"count\":{\"songsMillion\":\"180\",\"videos\":\"650,000\",\"videosShort\":\"650K\"},\"disclaimer\":{\"availableInUS\":\"Currently available only in the US\"},\"errorPage\":{\"contentBlockedText\":\"Back to {homepageLink}\",\"contentBlockedTitle\":\"Sorry, the content you are trying to access is not currently available in your region.\",\"errorTitle\":\"Error\"},\"faq\":{\"1\":{\"whatIsTidal\":{\"answer\":\"With over 180 million tracks and 650,000 videos, TIDAL let\\'s you stream and download the music you love at the best sound quality available. Create your own playlists, or try one of ours – hand-curated by music experts and the artists themselves.\",\"question\":\"What is TIDAL?\"}},\"2\":{\"paymentMethods\":{\"answer\":\"VISA, MasterCard, American Express, Discover and PayPal are all acceptable forms of payment.\",\"question\":\"What payment methods are available?\"}},\"3\":{\"anyDevice\":{\"answer\":\"TIDAL will work on most smartphones, tablets and personal computers. The TIDAL platform also supports a wide range of network players including Sonos, Bluesound, Linn, Auralic, Mirage, Squeezebox, Amarra, McIntosh, Wadia, Electrocompaniet, Meridian and Lode.\",\"question\":\"Can I use TIDAL on any device?\"}},\"4\":{\"listenOnline\":{\"answer\":\"No. TIDAL HiFi and HiFi Plus both have a feature called Offline Mode, which allows you to download content to your device and play it at any time, even when there is no network available.\",\"question\":\"Do I have to be online to listen to my music?\"}},\"5\":{\"cancelSubscription\":{\"answer\":\"You can cancel your subscription at any time. In the TIDAL platform go to Settings, click the Subscription Tab and then click the \\\\\"Update Your Subscription\\\\\" button. Choose \\\\\"Subscription\\\\\" and then select whether you\\'d like to upgrade, downgrade or cancel your subscription.\",\"question\":\"How do I cancel my TIDAL subscription?\"}},\"6\":{\"importPlaylist\":{\"answer\":\"Yes. By using {importLink} you can import your playlists into TIDAL.\",\"question\":\"Can I import my playlists from other streaming services I use?\"}},\"7\":{\"redeemVoucher\":{\"answer\":\"If you have received the voucher, visit TIDAL.com and click Redeem Voucher in the page\\'s footer. Then enter the voucher code and click Continue to create a TIDAL account. Enjoy music in TIDAL!\",\"question\":\"How to redeem voucher?\"}},\"header\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"importPlaylists\":{\"answer\":\"Yes, we want your transition to TIDAL to be as smooth as possible. Start importing your favorite playlists <a href=\\\\\"{website}\\\\\">here</a>.\",\"question\":\"Can I bring my playlists on other services to TIDAL?\"},\"mobileBandwidth\":{\"answer\":\"HiFi streaming works really well on 4G/LTE networks. We have also had great results streaming over 3G, but if you’re moving quickly, like on a train or in a car, we recommend using offline mode to ensure uninterrupted playback.\",\"question\":\"Does HiFi work with mobile bandwidth?\"},\"resetPassword\":{\"answer\":\"<ul>\\\\n<li>Open the TIDAL app on any device.</li>\\\\n<li>Tap “Log in” on the home page and then “Reset password”.</li>\\\\n<li>As your username enter the e-mail address you used when signing up.</li>\\\\n<li>After a moment you will receive an e-mail with a link which will allow you to set up a new password.</li>\\\\n<li>Follow the instructions.</li>\\\\n<li>After changing the password, you can log in to TIDAL with your new password.</li>\\\\n</ul>\",\"question\":\"How can I reset my password?\"},\"tidalPlans\":{\"answer\":\"TIDAL’s most popular plan is the Individual plan. In addition to that, we offer a high-value Family plan (for you plus up to 5 members), and a discounted Student plan.\",\"question\":\"What plan types does TIDAL offer?\"},\"tryTIDAL\":{\"answer\":\"Yes, you get a free trial period when you sign up to TIDAL – and you can cancel your account at any time.\",\"answer_new\":\"If you haven’t tried TIDAL before, you’ll be able to sign up for a 30 day free trial. TIDAL’s free trial gives you complete, ad-free access to TIDAL’s lossless catalog and streaming features at no cost.\",\"question\":\"Can I try TIDAL free of charge?\",\"question_new\":\"Can I try TIDAL for free?\"},\"upgradeSubscription\":{\"answer\":\"If you already have a TIDAL HiFi membership you can upgrade to TIDAL HiFi Plus from your account page here: <a href=\\\\\"https://account.tidal.com/login\\\\\">account.tidal.com/login</a>\",\"question\":\"How do I upgrade from TIDAL HiFi to a TIDAL HiFi Plus subscription?\"}},\"footer\":{\"about\":\"About\",\"aboutText\":\"TIDAL is the first global music streaming service with high fidelity sound, hi-def video quality, along with expertly curated playlists and original content — making it a trusted source for music and culture.\",\"accessibility\":\"Accessibility Statement\",\"account\":\"Account\",\"career\":\"Careers\",\"company\":\"Company\",\"contact\":\"Contact\",\"cookiesSettings\":\"Cookie Settings\",\"culture\":\"Culture\",\"description\":\"TIDAL is an artist-first, fan-centered music streaming platform that delivers over 180 million songs in HiFi sound quality to the global music community.\",\"discoverTidal\":\"Discover TIDAL\",\"download\":\"Download TIDAL\",\"exploreApp\":\"Explore the App\",\"forArtists\":\"For Artists\",\"forMusic\":\"For Music\",\"getOffer\":\"Get Offer\",\"getStarted\":\"Get Started\",\"getSupport\":\"Get Support\",\"jpCommercialTransactionsAct\":\"Commercial Transactions Act\",\"magazine\":\"Magazine\",\"manageAccount\":\"Manage Account\",\"partners\":\"Partners\",\"playlistImport\":\"Playlist Import\",\"press\":\"Press\",\"pricingPlans\":\"Pricing & Plans\",\"privacyPolicy\":\"Privacy Notice\",\"redeemGiftcard\":\"Redeem Giftcard\",\"redeemVoucher\":\"Redeem Voucher\",\"signUp\":\"Sign Up\",\"slaveryStatement\":\"Modern Slavery Statement\",\"soundQuality\":\"Sound Quality\",\"startFreeTrial\":\"Start Free Trial\",\"store\":\"Store\",\"supportedDevices\":\"Supported Devices\",\"termsConditions\":\"Terms and Conditions\",\"transferMusic\":\"Transfer Music\",\"videoNotAvailable\":\"Video content is not available in your country.\",\"whatIsTidal\":\"What is TIDAL?\"},\"form\":{\"clearInput\":\"Clear input\",\"hidePassword\":\"Hide password\",\"selectOption\":\"Select an option\",\"showPassword\":\"Show password\"},\"formError\":{\"birthday\":{\"ageError\":\"You must be at least %s years old\",\"emptyError\":\"You must fill out all the fields\",\"invalidDateError\":\"The date you entered is invalid\"},\"maxNumber\":{\"number\":\"The value of this field should be {0} or lower.\"},\"maxlength\":{\"default\":\"This field can\\'t be longer than {0} characters.\",\"password\":\"The password can\\'t be longer than {0} characters.\"},\"minNumber\":{\"number\":\"The value of this field should be {0} or greater.\"},\"minlength\":{\"default\":\"This field needs to be at least {0} characters long.\",\"password\":\"The password needs to be at least {0} characters long.\"},\"required\":{\"default\":\"This field is required.\",\"password\":\"A password is required.\"}},\"generic\":{\"addon\":\"Add-on\",\"addonsAvaliable\":\"ADD-ONS AVAILABLE\",\"aprilDay\":\"April {day}\",\"cancelAnytime\":\"Cancel at any time.\",\"comingSoon\":\"Coming Soon\",\"comparePlans\":\"Compare Plans\",\"emailAddress\":\"Email address\",\"enterPassword\":\"Enter a password\",\"favoriteMusic\":\"All your favorite music.<br>Best sound quality available.\",\"features\":{\"expertPlaylists\":\"Expertly curated playlists\",\"hifiMasters\":\"HiFi and TIDAL Masters\",\"offlineListening\":\"Offline listening\",\"offlineUnlimited\":\"Ad-free and offline listening with unlimited skips\",\"unlimitedSkips\":\"Unlimited skips\",\"unlimitedSkipsAdFree\":\"Unlimited skips, ad-free\"},\"februaryDay\":\"February {day}\",\"gettingStarted\":\"Getting started\",\"julyDay\":\"July {day}\",\"latestReleases\":\"Latest releases\",\"learnMore\":\"Learn more\",\"learnMoreAboutTidal\":\"Learn more about TIDAL\",\"loading\":\"Loading\",\"marchDay\":\"March {day}\",\"mayDay\":\"May {day}\",\"no\":\"No\",\"noSubscription\":\"No Subscription\",\"nothingFound\":\"Nothing found\",\"numberOfResults\":\"Number of results: {number}\",\"onlyNewCustomers\":\"Only valid for new customers.\",\"openTIDAL\":\"Open TIDAL\",\"other\":\"Other\",\"podcasts\":\"Podcasts\",\"presave\":{\"now\":\"Pre-Save Now\"},\"product\":{\"infoNumbers\":\"180 million songs and more than 650,000 videos from your favorite artists. Unlimited access to editorial playlists, artist exclusives and Live events.\",\"platform\":\"A global music streaming and entertainment platform\"},\"progressBar\":\"Progress bar\",\"releases\":\"Releases\",\"searchField\":{\"placeholder\":\"Search\"},\"selectPlan\":\"Select a plan to start your trial\",\"share\":\"Share\",\"thankYou\":\"Thank You!\",\"tidalMagazine\":\"TIDAL Magazine\",\"tryTIDAL\":\"Try TIDAL for free.\",\"tryTier\":\"Try {tierName}\",\"upcomingReleases\":\"Upcoming releases\",\"whatIsTidal\":{\"moreInfo\":\"For more information about TIDAL visit: {whatIsTidalLink}\",\"text1\":\"TIDAL is a global, experiential, entertainment platform built for fans, directly from artists around the world. TIDAL members enjoy exclusively curated content that directly connect artists with their fans in multiple ways.\",\"text2\":\"The service offers high-fidelity, CD sound quality music, high resolution video, an opportunity to discover new artists via TIDAL Rising and unique experiences via TIDAL X. With a catalog of more than 180 million songs and 650,000 high quality videos TIDAL offers its members a complete music experience and allow fans to establish a closer connection with their favorite artists.\",\"title\":\"What is TIDAL?\"},\"yes\":\"Yes\"},\"header\":{\"about\":\"About\",\"campaignText\":\"Confirm Offer\",\"culture\":\"Culture\",\"download\":\"Download TIDAL\",\"exploreApp\":\"Explore the App\",\"forArtists\":\"For Artists\",\"forMusic\":\"For Music\",\"getHelp\":\"Get Help\",\"getOffer\":\"Get Offer\",\"homeText\":\"Home\",\"listenText\":\"Listen\",\"loginText\":\"Log in\",\"logoutText\":\"Log out\",\"magazineText\":\"Magazine\",\"manageAccountText\":\"Manage Account\",\"myAccountText\":\"My Account\",\"new\":\"New\",\"openApp\":\"Open App\",\"playlistImport\":\"Playlist Import\",\"pricingPlans\":\"Pricing & Plans\",\"skipToFooter\":\"Skip to footer\",\"skipToLanguageSwitcher\":\"Skip to language switcher\",\"skipToMain\":\"Skip to main content\",\"startFreeTrialShortText\":\"Start Free Trial\",\"startFreeTrialText\":\"Start Free Trial\",\"support\":\"Support\",\"supportedDevices\":\"Supported Devices\",\"transferMusic\":\"Transfer Music\",\"webPlayer\":\"Web Player\",\"whatIsTidal\":\"What is TIDAL?\"},\"memberBenefits\":{\"1\":{\"tidalX\":{\"copy\":\"Gain entry to TIDAL X events just for members including live concerts, meet & greets, intimate Q&As, listening parties and more.\",\"header\":\"TIDAL X\"}},\"2\":{\"tickets\":{\"copy\":\"TIDAL members get first opportunity to purchase the hottest tickets with pre-sales from top artists as well as ticket giveaways to see your favorite artists live.\",\"header\":\"Tickets\"}},\"3\":{\"originalContent\":{\"copy\":\"Learn more about your favorite artists with original documentaries, podcasts and interviews available only on TIDAL.\",\"header\":\"Original Content\"}},\"title\":\"Member benefits\"},\"months\":[\"January\",\"February\",\"March\",\"April\",\"May\",\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\",\"December\"],\"notAvailableInYourCountry\":\"Unfortunately, this is currently not available in your country.\",\"plan\":{\"family\":\"Family\",\"familyUsers\":\"Family (up to 6 users)\",\"standard\":\"Individual\",\"student\":\"Student\"},\"plusApplicableSalesTax\":\"Plus applicable sales tax.\",\"price\":{\"perMonthShort\":\"{price} / month\"},\"productBenefits\":{\"1\":{\"hifi\":\"180+ million high-fidelity songs\",\"premium\":\"180+ million songs\"},\"2\":\"650,000+ music videos\",\"3\":\"Expertly-curated playlists\",\"4\":\"Exclusive music, videos, and artist content\",\"5\":\"Access to live events and ticket giveaways\"},\"productSelector\":{\"continueButton\":\"Continue with {planName}\",\"disclaimer\":\"Renews at <span class=\\\\\"color-white\\\\\">{price}/month</span>.<br>Cancel anytime at tidal.com.<br>Only valid for new customers.\",\"disclaimerPlusTax\":\"Renews at <span class=\\\\\"color-white\\\\\">{price}/month</span> + applicable sales tax.<br>Cancel anytime at tidal.com.<br>Only valid for new customers.\",\"header\":\"Choose a subscription\",\"hifi\":{\"description\":\"Get high sound quality: up to 16-bit, 44.1 kHz, including 180M+ songs in FLAC.\",\"intro\":\"Includes High Quality up to 16-bit, 44.1 kHz FLAC lossless.\"},\"hifiPlus\":{\"description\":\"Get max sound quality: up to 24-bit, 192 kHz. Includes HiRes FLAC, Dolby Atmos, and more.\",\"intro\":\"Includes Max Audio Quality: up to 24-bit, 19kHz, HiRes FLAC lossless\"},\"planFeatures\":{\"price\":\"{price} per month\",\"qualityHiFi\":\"HiFi sound quality and MQA\",\"qualityMaster\":\"Master sound quality\",\"qualityMasterKbps\":\"2304-9216 kbps (best)\",\"qualityPremium\":\"Premium sound quality\",\"qualityStandard\":\"Standard sound quality\",\"qualityStandardKbs\":\"320 kbps (good)\",\"soundQualityHiFi\":\"HiFi sound quality\",\"soundQualityHiFiKbs\":\"1411 kbps (better)\",\"trial\":\"30-day free trial\"},\"priceForDays\":\"{price} for 30 days\",\"seeLess\":\"See less plans\",\"seeMore\":\"See more plans\"},\"recaptchaTC\":\"This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google <a target=\\\\\"_blank\\\\\" href=\\\\\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\\\\\">Privacy Policy</a> and <a target=\\\\\"_blank\\\\\" href=\\\\\"https://policies.google.com/terms\\\\\">Terms of Service</a> apply.\",\"reloadAndTryAgain\":\"Please reload the page and try again.\",\"tagline\":{\"hifi\":\"Clearly the best sound.\"},\"taglineForYourMusic\":\"For Your <em>Music</em>\",\"tier\":{\"free\":\"Free\",\"hifi\":\"HiFi Plus\",\"premium\":\"HiFi\"},\"usp\":{\"adFree\":{\"title\":\"Ad-free\",\"title_new\":\"Ad-free listening\"},\"directArtistPayouts\":{\"detail\":\"Up to 10% of your subscription is directed to the artists you listen to the most\",\"title\":\"Direct Artist Payouts\"},\"download\":{\"title\":\"Download & listen offline\"},\"expertCuratePlaylists\":{\"title\":\"Expert curated playlists\"},\"hifiQuality\":{\"detail\":\"Up to 1411 kbps\",\"title\":\"HiFi Sound Quality\"},\"highAudio\":{\"detail\":\"16-bit, 44.1 kHz\",\"detail_new\":\"16-bit, 44.1 kHz in FLAC.\",\"title\":\"High sound quality\"},\"immersive\":{\"detail\":\"Includes Dolby Atmos and Sony 360 Reality Audio.\",\"title\":\"Immersive formats\"},\"immersiveInnovativeAudio\":{\"detail\":\"Up to 9216 kbps\",\"more\":\"Master Quality Authenticated (MQA), Dolby Atmos, Sony 